{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>【Now新聞台】行政長官李家超今日(11月19日)出席APEC領導人非正式會議，並與其他經濟體領導人會面。另外，見龍在田赤洲與內地恐龍化石展在九龍公園文物探知館舉行開幕禮。</p><p>採訪日誌｜李家超出席APEC領導人非正式會議／赤洲與內地恐龍化石展開幕</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T23:44:24.231716+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T23:30:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T23:37:53.036482+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T23:37:53.036482+00:00","content_hash":"1cebb6e4c4c7e0ef4a65609493f91b38eae0c9130b5ddd7f16f7f9952b3beb41","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}